<section id="A1.SSx2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Comparative Question Generation</h3>

<div id="A1.SSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The following is an example prompt for generating questions that factor in the visual distinctiveness of the target concept A versus B.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SSx2.p2" class="ltx_para">
