<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Appendix B: Case Study</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This appendix presents a full case study of how the model performs on two visually similar food items: <span id="A2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Gujia</span> (target) and <span id="A2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Chandrakala</span> (distractor).</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F7" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.15059v1/gujia-vs-chandrakala.png" id="A2.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:279/152;" width="279" height="152" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>(a) An image of the target concept (gujia) and (b) a visually similar distractor (chandrakala).</figcaption>
</figure>
