<section id="A2.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Detailed Model Reasoning (Contrastive Questions)</h3>

<section id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Q1: What is a key feature of the object in the image?</h5>

<div id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Correct Answer:</span> B) Half-moon shaped</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Gujia:</span>
”The objects in the image have a folded appearance with crimped edges, resembling a crescent or half-moon shape. This suggests the best option is: B) Half-moon shaped.”
<span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Correct</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Chandrakala:</span>
”The objects appear rounded with a decorative edge. Based on the sun-like appearance, the model selects: C) Sun-shaped using two dough circles.”
<span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Incorrect</span></p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Q2: Which of the following is unique to the object shown?</h5>

<div id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Correct Answer:</span> B) Looks like an empanada</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Gujia:</span>
”The appearance closely resembles an empanada, with a half-moon shape and crimped edge. Best answer: B) Looks like an empanada.”
<span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px2.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Correct</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Chandrakala:</span>
”The object seems more circular and enclosed. Based on that, selects: C) Associated with moonlight shape.”
<span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px2.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Incorrect</span></p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Q3: How does the object differ from others?</h5>

<div id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Correct Answer:</span> B) Uses a single layer of dough folded over</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Gujia:</span>
”The crescent shape suggests they are folded over from a single layer. Correct choice: B).”
<span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px3.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Correct</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px3.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Chandrakala:</span>
”Flat-topped and round, suggesting two separate dough layers. Selects: D) Two circles for sun shape.”
<span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px3.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Incorrect</span></p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Q4: What is visible in the image?</h5>

<div id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Correct Answer:</span> B) A shape that mimics an empanada</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px4.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px4.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Gujia:</span>
”Classic empanada-like semicircular shape with crimped edges. Selects: B).”
<span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px4.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Correct</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px4.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px4.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Chandrakala:</span>
”Dome-like and circular, with no folding. Selects: C) Rounded from a single circle of dough.”
<span id="A2.SSx1.SSS0.Px4.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Incorrect</span></p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2.SSx2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Conclusion</h3>

<div id="A2.SSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This case demonstrates that original questions resulted in a narrow performance gap (Gujia 3/5, Chandrakala 2/5), while contrastive questions achieved clear separation (Gujia 4/4, Chandrakala 0/4).</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
</article>
